# Johns Chili

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202235345/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. 148

{ rating="2" image="johns_chili.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Main Ingredients

- [ ] 1 lb [ground turkey]{ ing="ground-turkey" }
- [ ] 1 medium [onion]{ ing="onion" }, chopped
- [ ] 1 cup [mushrooms]{ ing="mushrooms" }, chopped
- [ ] 2 Tbsp (Lawry’s) [seasoning salt]{ ing="seasoning-salt" } (see substitute below)
- [ ] 3 Tbsp [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [cayenne pepper]{ ing="cayenne-pepper" }
- [ ] 3 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 2 cups [water]{ ing="water" }
- [ ] 2 (15 oz) cans [tomato sauce]{ ing="tomato-sauce" }
- [ ] 2 (15 oz) cans [kidney beans]{ ing="kidney-beans" }, drained
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [light brown sugar]{ ing="light-brown-sugar" }

### Lawry’s Seasoning Salt Substitute

- [ ] 1 tsp [garlic powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [onion powder]{ ing="onion-powder" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [paprika]{ ing="paprika" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [ground turmeric]{ ing="ground-turmeric" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [white sugar]{ ing="white-sugar" }

### Toppings

- [ ] (Optional) [Plain Yogurt]{ ing="plain-yogurt" }
- [ ] (Optional) [Shredded cheese]{ ing="shredded-cheese" }
- [ ] (Optional) [Crushed tortilla chips]{ ing="crushed-tortilla-chips" }

## Recipe

1. Heat a large pot over medium heat. Add the [ground turkey]{ ing="ground-turkey" }, [onion]{ ing="onion" }, [mushrooms]{ ing="mushrooms" }, [seasoning salt]{ ing="seasoning-salt" } (or substitute), [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }, and cayenne
1. Cook for 8 min. Add the [garlic]{ ing="garlic" } and cook for 1 additional min
1. Add 2 cups [water]{ ing="water" }, the [tomato sauce]{ ing="tomato-sauce" }, [kidney beans]{ ing="kidney-beans" }, [brown sugar]{ ing="light-brown-sugar" }, and bring to a boil
1. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 35-45 min to thicken slightly and flavor-mingle

## Notes

1. Freezes or can be stored in the fridge. Tastes great when reheated.
1. Serves 6-8
